<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="main-content">
<section class="sh-page-hero" aria-label="Request a consultation"><div class="sh-container"><span class="sh-hero__tag">Engineering Advisory</span><h1>Bring the Problem. We'll Work Through the Engineering.</h1><p>Schedule a session with our team to review feasibility, design, materials, manufacturing strategy, cost, or prototype development.</p></div></section>
<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="consultation-heading"><div class="sh-container"><div class="row align-items-start g-4 g-lg-5"><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="sh-section-title sh-section-title--left" style="max-width:600px;margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-8);"><span style="display:inline-block;color:var(--sh-brand);font-size:var(--sh-text-xs);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">What We Can Review</span><h2>Get engineering clarity before you commit to production.</h2><p>A consultation helps when the path forward is not yet obvious. We can help structure the problem and identify practical next steps.</p></div><div class="sh-grid sh-grid--2"><article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="font-size:var(--sh-text-base);">Design & Feasibility</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Review a concept, drawing, or existing part for manufacturability.</p></article><article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="font-size:var(--sh-text-base);">Materials</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Compare material choices against cost and application requirements.</p></article><article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="font-size:var(--sh-text-base);">Process Planning</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Choose a practical manufacturing route for the required outcome.</p></article><article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="font-size:var(--sh-text-base);">Cost Optimisation</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Identify opportunities to improve production economics.</p></article><article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="font-size:var(--sh-text-base);">Prototype Development</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Plan a path from concept to physical validation.</p></article><article class="sh-card sh-animate"><h4 style="font-size:var(--sh-text-base);">Training</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Build practical CAD/CAM and manufacturing capability.</p></article></div></div><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="sh-card" style="padding:var(--sh-space-8);"><div class="sh-section-title sh-section-title--left" style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-8);"><span style="display:inline-block;color:var(--sh-brand);font-size:var(--sh-text-xs);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Consultation Request</span><h2 id="consultation-heading" style="font-size:var(--sh-text-3xl);">Tell us what you need help with.</h2><p>We will review your request and contact you to agree on the next step.</p></div><form action="/request-consultation" method="POST"><div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-10000px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;"><label for="c-website">Website</label><input type="text" id="c-website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="sh-form-group"><label for="c-name" class="sh-label">Full Name *</label><input type="text" id="c-name" name="name" class="sh-input" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your full name"></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="sh-form-group"><label for="c-email" class="sh-label">Email *</label><input type="email" id="c-email" name="email" class="sh-input" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com"></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="sh-form-group"><label for="c-phone" class="sh-label">Phone *</label><input type="tel" id="c-phone" name="phone" class="sh-input" required maxlength="30" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+234 ..."></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="sh-form-group"><label for="c-company" class="sh-label">Company / Organization</label><input type="text" id="c-company" name="company" class="sh-input" maxlength="255" placeholder="Company or organisation"></div></div></div><div class="sh-form-group"><label for="c-topic" class="sh-label">Consultation Topic *</label><select id="c-topic" name="topic" class="sh-select" required><option value="">Select a topic</option><option value="design-review">Design Review & Feasibility</option><option value="material-selection">Material Selection Advice</option><option value="process-planning">Manufacturing Process Planning</option><option value="cost-optimization">Cost Optimization</option><option value="prototype">Prototype Development</option><option value="training">Training & Skills Development</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div><div class="sh-form-group"><label for="c-pref" class="sh-label">Preferred Contact Method</label><select id="c-pref" name="preference" class="sh-select"><option value="phone">Phone Call</option><option value="video">Video Call (Zoom/Teams)</option><option value="in-person">In-Person Meeting</option><option value="email">Email Exchange</option></select></div><div class="sh-form-group"><label for="c-message" class="sh-label">Tell Us About Your Project</label><textarea id="c-message" name="message" class="sh-textarea" maxlength="12000" placeholder="Brief overview of the engineering problem, current design, constraints, or decision you need help with..."></textarea></div><div class="sh-flex sh-items-center sh-justify-between" style="gap:var(--sh-space-4);flex-wrap:wrap;"><p class="sh-text-small" style="margin:0;">No obligation. We use your information only to respond to this request.</p><button type="submit" class="sh-btn sh-btn--primary sh-btn--lg">Request Consultation</button></div></form></div></div></div></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %><%- include('partials/scripts') %>